  message: "Merged in PR #1459 (dev ecbb226a0d).\n\nDone. Branch jgstern-agent/fix/lopus, commits 9952d96590 and b0a42e613d. The untyped_receiver caveat now consults the catalogue's `ambiguous_names` (the row choice's collision set): colliding sites are listed last, named in their own clause, and carried in `known_collisions`. Nothing is suppressed.\n\nBehavioural evidence: verify-claims on hypergumbo's own tree with the shipped claims. Every host_fs caveat now leads with `chmod(), mkdir(), truncate(), unlink(), write_text()` and says \"93 of them call a name the catalogue lists as a known short-name collision … (extract(), extractall(), rename(), replace(), write()); they are listed last.\" Verdicts and entries are unchanged (18/18 confirmed_with_caveats). Pinned by `test_untyped_receiver_known_collisions.py`, including the end-to-end `test_the_verdict_carries_the_marked_caveat`.\n\n---"  # bfa2
